</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Ça va bien !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'm good!</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Ça va bien !","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234566,"_nanoseconds":804000000}},{"id":"vsQyGwMFek1ZQGWY3H2H","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":7,"part":10,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l07-p10-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 2/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>On joue ? Touche ton nez !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Shall we play? Touch your nose!</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Voilà, mon nez !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Here, my nose!</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Voilà, mon nez !","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234566,"_nanoseconds":830000000}},{"id":"uG8LXhg4nLLNc0griyKw","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":7,"part":11,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l07-p11-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 3/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Touche ta tête !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Touch your head!</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Voilà, ma tête !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Here, my head!</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Voilà, ma tête !","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234566,"_nanoseconds":833000000}},{"id":"DEDZ00mefUJrxACX9QXJ","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":7,"part":12,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l07-p12-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 4/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Combien de mains ?</b><br>